{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TyjaJty8QNAK45wF3tvZQm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-15-1000-vpmm-bulk-page-creation\n2\t\n3\tReplace the per-page `cuMemCreate + cuMemMap` loop in the VPMM's `defragment_or_create_new_pages` with a single bulk `cuMemCreate` of the total needed size, followed by per-page offset-based `cuMemMap` calls. The first segment's `rs_code_matrix` allocation triggers ~128 individual page creations (~58ms on APC 300 seg 0), where `cuMemCreate` is the dominant cost (~0.4ms per call). A single bulk allocation reduces this to ~7ms. Unlike the failed pool-warming approach (task `cache-codeword-buffer-across-segments`), this does not change the pool's free-region state or VA layout — it only changes how physical pages are created, leaving all downstream memory access patterns identical.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb5d1119-b0b0-4361-9117-64026afc483a","uuid":"b387eaee-890c-43b5-afde-37639ec42494","timestamp":"2026-04-15T07:56:55.848Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-15-1000-vpmm-bulk-page-creation\n\nReplace the per-page `cuMemCreate + cuMemMap` loop in the VPMM's `defragment_or_create_new_pages` with a single bulk `cuMemCreate` of the total needed size, followed by per-page offset-based `cuMemMap` calls. The first segment's `rs_code_matrix` allocation triggers ~128 individual page creations (~58ms on APC 300 seg 0), where `cuMemCreate` is the dominant cost (~0.4ms per call). A single bulk allocation reduces this to ~7ms. Unlike the failed pool-warming approach (task `cache-codeword-buffer-across-segments`), this does not change the pool's free-region state or VA layout — it only changes how physical pages are created, leaving all downstream memory access patterns identical.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
